{"id":"c16f62394146a157","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Atomless Measure Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Atomless Measure Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra","58-df-zfc-measure7-atomless-measure-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Atomless Measure Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-atomless-measure-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Atomless Measure Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_B b\\coloneqq a\\wedge b=a\">\\(a\\leq_B b\\coloneqq a\\wedge b=a\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;_B b\\coloneqq a\\leq_Bb\\land a\\neq b\">\\(a&lt;_B b\\coloneqq a\\leq_Bb\\land a\\neq b\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}atomless\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb A=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\mu,B,[0,\\infty])\n\\land\\bar\\mu(0)=0\\land\\bar\\mu(1)&lt;\\infty\n\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\\bar\\mu(a)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,B)\\land\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to s(m)\\wedge s(n)=0)\n\\to\\exists b\\in B\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in B\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B c)\\to b\\leq_B c\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar\\mu(b)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\bar\\mu(s(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\n\\exists b\\in B\\;(0&lt;_B b&lt;_B a))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}atomless\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb A=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\mu,B,[0,\\infty])\n\\land\\bar\\mu(0)=0\\land\\bar\\mu(1)&lt;\\infty\n\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\\bar\\mu(a)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,B)\\land\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to s(m)\\wedge s(n)=0)\n\\to\\exists b\\in B\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in B\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B c)\\to b\\leq_B c\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar\\mu(b)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\bar\\mu(s(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\n\\exists b\\in B\\;(0&lt;_B b&lt;_B a))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countable joins are expressed by their least-upper-bound property in the Boolean order; the former undeclared symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{n\\in\\omega}s(n)\">\\(\\bigvee_{n\\in\\omega}s(n)\\)</span> could silently assume the very completeness being defined.</li>\n<li>The set-coded measure is finite, strictly positive, countably additive on disjoint sequences, and the Boolean algebra is atomless.</li>\n<li>The measure7 atomless-measure-algebra variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (typed set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq_B b\\coloneqq a\\wedge b=a","display":false},{"tex":"a<_B b\\coloneqq a\\leq_Bb\\land a\\neq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}atomless\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4AtomlessMeasureAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathbb A=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1,\\bar\\mu\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar\\mu,B,[0,\\infty])\n\\land\\bar\\mu(0)=0\\land\\bar\\mu(1)<\\infty\n\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\\bar\\mu(a)>0)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,B)\\land\n\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to s(m)\\wedge s(n)=0)\n\\to\\exists b\\in B\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B b)\n\\land\\forall c\\in B\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(s(n)\\leq_B c)\\to b\\leq_B c\\bigr)\n\\land\\bar\\mu(b)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\bar\\mu(s(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\neq0\\to\n\\exists b\\in B\\;(0<_B b<_B a))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{n\\in\\omega}s(n)","display":false}],"bytes":2239,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2590","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-atomless-measure-algebra]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e","36d7463d215be751"]}